{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NuWdidC4Mr6wkFZinxCitw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Brief: make claude model configurable\n2\t\n3\tstatus: open\n4\ttype: feature\n5\tid: measure\n6\tbranch: feature/measure_make-claude-model-configurable\n7\tdate: 2026-08-29\n8\tauthor: Leander Muskalla\n9\t\n10\t## What\n11\t\n12\tIf I want to add a new profile that use claude code, I cannot specify the model.\n13\tHowever, it is absolutely necessary for this to work.\n14\tI need to be able to define that I want to use claude code with a specific model, e.g. sonnet.\n15\t\n16\t## Why\n17\t\n18\t<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n19\t\n20\t## Out of scope\n21\t\n22\t<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n23\t\n24\t## Notes\n25\t\n26\t<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d629eb66-acaf-40dd-96c0-a389600366c5","uuid":"51a1753d-d5bf-4141-9328-364cb6ae1203","timestamp":"2026-08-29T08:56:16.828Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/measure_make-claude-model-configurable/brief.md","content":"# Brief: make claude model configurable\n\nstatus: open\ntype: feature\nid: measure\nbranch: feature/measure_make-claude-model-configurable\ndate: 2026-08-29\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\n\n## What\n\nIf I want to add a new profile that use claude code, I cannot specify the model.\nHowever, it is absolutely necessary for this to work.\nI need to be able to define that I want to use claude code with a specific model, e.g. sonnet.\n\n## Why\n\n<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n\n## Out of scope\n\n<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n\n## Notes\n\n<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n","numLines":27,"startLine":1,"totalLines":27}}}
