{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UfLt12kHrSp36QPW87KYVX","type":"tool_result","content":"21:## Where everything lives\n23:### The manigot repo\n73:### Each project\n111:## Setup (once)\n113:### Profiles\n155:# 1. Build the image\n159:# 2. Put the launchers on your PATH\n161:# make install PREFIX=/usr/local        # ...or a system-wide location (may need sudo)\n164:### `claude-pro` — Claude Code, Claude Pro subscription\n167:# 1. Extract your account info from your host (requires Claude Code installed locally)\n173:# 2. Add credentials to .env\n174:# Get CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN by running: claude setup-token\n183:### `zai` — OpenCode, Z.AI Coding Plan\n192:# optional: which model this profile defaults to, as provider/model\n197:### `opencode-go` — OpenCode, OpenCode Go subscription\n207:# optional: which model this profile defaults to, as provider/model.\n208:# Go model ids use the opencode-go/ prefix (e.g. opencode-go/deepseek-v4-flash)\n213:### `opencode-zen` — OpenCode, OpenCode Zen\n223:# optional: which model this profile defaults to, as provider/model.\n224:# Zen's (billed) DeepSeek V4 Flash model is opencode/deepseek-v4-flash\n229:### `opencode-zen-free` — OpenCode, OpenCode Zen (free)\n238:# optional: which model this profile defaults to, as provider/model.\n239:# Zen's free DeepSeek V4 Flash model is opencode/deepseek-v4-flash-free\n254:### Theme (OpenCode)\n278:### The installed commands\n307:### Installing without symlinks\n313:# ~/.zshrc or ~/.bashrc\n324:## Per-project setup\n343:# Copy the template into your project\n346:# Fill in your project context\n363:## Usage\n366:# Bootstrap a project for the job workflow (one-time, see Per-project setup)\n370:# Start a manigot session (run from anywhere, in any project — docs/ optional)\n380:# List all commands\n383:# Start straight in an agent, or on a job\n389:# Start an agent with an ad-hoc initial prompt, outside the job workflow\n392:# Create a new job\n397:# Archive a finished job\n400:# Remove orphaned docker containers left behind by abnormal session ends\n403:# Drive a job unattended: @analyst -> @developer -> @reviewer, end to end\n407:# Run a session on the host — no docker container (work that must touch the host)\n426:## Choosing a profile\n501:### Host mode (`mg host`)\n554:## Clipboard / copying from agent sessions\n594:## Agents\n628:### Agent frontmatter and guardrails\n658:## Skills\n690:## Meta prompt\n728:## Job workflow\n741:# creates: docs/jobs/flower_add-image-gallery-block/   (inside the job's worktree)\n742:#   brief.md    ← you fill in: what and why\n743:#   tasks.md    ← @analyst fills in: atomic task breakdown\n744:#   implementation.md  ← @developer fills in: what was implemented\n745:#   verdict.md  ← @reviewer and/or @security fill in: pass/fail per task\n746:# creates branch: feature/flower_add-image-gallery-block\n747:# creates worktree: ../.manigot-worktrees/<project>/flower_add-image-gallery-block\n788:### How to get a job done\n819:### Autonomous mode (`mg jdi`)\n889:## TUI\n908:### Supported platforms\n941:### Build & install\n954:### Run\n961:### Keybindings\n1051:### Settings\n1080:### Stage timeline\n1111:### mg jdi status & log\n1157:## Listener\n1172:# <manigot checkout>/config/serve.json  (override with --registry)\n1260:## Rebuilding","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0ad41780-e2e7-4ebf-861d-9c61d66ababf","uuid":"7c1aa0d6-7c19-46a8-9e27-49851b981811","timestamp":"2026-08-29T09:08:52.843Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"21:## Where everything lives\n23:### The manigot repo\n73:### Each project\n111:## Setup (once)\n113:### Profiles\n155:# 1. Build the image\n159:# 2. Put the launchers on your PATH\n161:# make install PREFIX=/usr/local        # ...or a system-wide location (may need sudo)\n164:### `claude-pro` — Claude Code, Claude Pro subscription\n167:# 1. Extract your account info from your host (requires Claude Code installed locally)\n173:# 2. Add credentials to